            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice O'Connor, justice O\u2019Connor also asked whether the statute provides for damages or attorney\u2019s fees."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c21766635739c600330da2e90e7e9778181b58393426832692c71ceb01d5be09",
