                "end": 3,
                "start": 3
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Jeffrey A. Lamken (Petitioners), according to Jeffrey A. Lamken (Petitioners), petitioner contends that Congress intended \u00a7332(c)(7) to expose local governments to \u00a71983 liability for antenna\u2011zoning decisions."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Lamken",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "c21766635739c600330da2e90e7e9778181b58393426832692c71ceb01d5be09",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-c21766635739-0002-0004"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 52,
                "start": 52
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Lamken, petitioner warns that allowing damages and attorney\u2019s fees under \u00a71983 for good\u2011faith mistakes in antenna siting would invite extensive litigation and impose fees that many municipalities could not afford."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Waxman",
          "citations": [
            {
