            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 53,
              "start": 53
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court emphasized that Section\u202f332(c)(7) was intended to preserve local authority, not to eliminate it."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c21766635739c600330da2e90e7e9778181b58393426832692c71ceb01d5be09",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c21766635739-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 41,
              "start": 41
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Congress\u2019s concern about \u201cintransigent, entrenched zoning authorities\u201d reflects a legislative intent to balance national wireless deployment with local control."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c21766635739c600330da2e90e7e9778181b58393426832692c71ceb01d5be09",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c21766635739-0003-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 53,
              "start": 53
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court noted that, absent an express limitations period in the statute, state law would normally govern the claim."
      }
    ],
